# Monorepo — MSGF & other workspace Docker builds
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
.git
.github

# Local env and secrets must not enter the image
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Docs and caches (optional size wins)
**/*.md
!README.md

**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# Tests / QA — keep IP and attack surface out of build context
**/tests
**/test
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.js
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/vitest.config.*
**/playwright.config.*
**/cypress
**/jest.config.*

# IDE / agent scaffolding (not needed to compile MSGF)
**/.cursor
**/.cursorrules
**/.agents

# Large local artifacts & generated audits
**/pre_ingestion_audit.md
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/service-account.json
**/gcp-key.json
